WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,960
starting from today

2
00:00:01,440 --> 00:00:02,600
Study for half an hour every day

3
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:04,760
Don't dare to be lazy even if you miss a minute

4
00:00:04,920 --> 00:00:10,600
I confiscated all the snacks you hid. What’s left today?

5
00:00:11,040 --> 00:00:15,820
Don’t Yu Yu like red bean paste buns? Give her some, Uncle Wang, are you okay?

6
00:00:17,330 --> 00:00:18,570
Business has been getting worse recently

7
00:00:18,770 --> 00:00:19,730
The rent is not cheap

8
00:00:20,130 --> 00:00:22,370
Lao Wang and I are planning to open a store in another location and move out.

9
00:00:22,850 --> 00:00:24,930
Your business has always been stable before, why is it suddenly so different?

10
00:00:25,860 --> 00:00:27,500
A new Western-style breakfast shop opened on the street

11
00:00:27,620 --> 00:00:29,460
I don’t know who brought it up and what they are saying now.

12
00:00:29,460 --> 00:00:33,180
Some people believe that steamed buns and fried dough sticks are only for poor people. Only by eating their sandwiches can they be considered refined and respectable.

13
00:00:33,940 --> 00:00:35,340
There are queues every day in other stores now

14
00:00:35,620 --> 00:00:39,500
We only have some old customers left, Shanzi, go buy two copies and come back.
